  dialogueLines:
  - '*I guess I ended up near the south end of the city*'
  - '"Hey, I don''t mean to bother you, but my friend and I just made it out of the
    city. Would you happen to have any supplies you could give us?"'
  - '"Well..."'
  - '"Yeah, you can have some."'
  - '[3 supplies lost]'
  - '"Thank you! This will be super helpful. I appreciate it."'
